  "limitations": [
    "Patterns are conservative sufficient evidence combinations for candidates, not diagnostic necessities.",
    "No unified low/moderate/high pulp score.",
    "Lingering pain is qualitative; 30 seconds is not a diagnostic cutoff.",
    "No automated asymptomatic irreversible pulpitis or treatment prescription.",
    "Revised AAE/ESE terminology remains a proposal on the reviewed page."
